  "id": "belonging",
  "term": "belonging",
  "definition": "In educational psychology, belonging usually refers to school belonging: a student’s subjective sense of being valued, included, and accepted by peers and teachers at school. It is understood as a developmental and context-dependent experience shaped by relationships, safety, opportunities, motivation, and how students perceive their school environment, rather than as a fixed personal trait.",
